WEBVTT

00:02:29.708 --> 00:02:32.630
And she hands me a gold bangle.

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:36.007
That was the only jewelry left with her.

00:02:37.187 --> 00:02:42.225
She said, "I don't have much but this
is for you to buy the bus ticket."

00:02:44.385 --> 00:02:46.282
You can see the bus ticket here.

00:02:46.282 --> 00:02:49.201
It's been ten years. I still have this.

00:02:49.841 --> 00:02:54.642
As a promise that I won't let my mom
sacrifice anything more for me.

00:02:55.762 --> 00:03:02.552
So, on 22nd of July, 2007, I arrived
in Pune, a city of four million people.